      "review_title": "",
      "review_description": "We obtained initial proposals for two options after a meeting at the Mode office.Having selected our preferred system an on site inspection was arranged which was carried out promptly and a quote confirmed.  Although the price was somewhat higher than that from an alternative supplier, the components were of higher quality and represented good value for the money.The installers arrived promptly as arranged and carried out the installation in a highly professional manner. It was a pleasant experience dealing with the whole team on site. Performance of the system so far is well up to expectation.All administrative aspects of the installation were handled by Mode. From the commencement to the completion of our solar installation we found Mode to be highly professional and efficient in their dealings with us and we have no hesitation in recommending this company.",
